    /// The long variant: 10,000 blocks through every configuration (4 at a
    /// time), a CF dump every 50 durable heights. Over nextest's 10 min cap:
    /// `cargo test -p torus-consensus --lib phase5_differential_long_random_10k
    /// -- --ignored`.
    #[test]
